Description:

The CalDAV server no longer honours the Schedule-Sender-Address and
Schedule-Sender-Name request headers.  These let a front end that had already
authenticated a message say on whose behalf a PUT or DELETE was made.  This was
an experimental feature, and that experiment has come to an end.


